{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38952","headline":"维扬春日再遇孙侍御 · 杜荀鹤","name":"维扬春日再遇孙侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本爲荣家不爲身，读书谁料转家贫。\n三年行却千山路，两地思归一主人。\n络岸柳丝悬细雨，绣田花朵弄残春。\n多情御史应嗟见，未上青云白发新。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38952.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38952","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}